# Keep the Docker build context small and free of machine-specific state.
# The image installs Java and Python packages itself; nothing local is reused.
#
# Rule: never exclude a repository file that a test reads. The image's default command runs the
# whole pytest suite, so an excluded input fails CI's docker job. (.github used to be listed here
# and broke tests/unit/test_infra_repro_files.py::test_ci_workflow_structure inside the image.)
# tests/unit/test_infra_repro_files.py checks this list against the files the tests read.
.git
.venv
venv
.tools
work
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
.mypy_cache
.coverage
build
dist
# Bulky regenerable raw traces (their hashes are tracked in run.json files).
results/raw/**/*.npz
results/raw/**/*.dat
# Reference PDFs of the specification are not needed to run anything.
docs/handoff/*.pdf
